WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.266 --> 00:00:05.399
Our heroes continue their journey to Shalour City,

2
00:00:05.466 --> 00:00:09.566
where Ash's next Kalos Gym battle challenge awaits!

3
00:00:11.799 --> 00:00:14.399
- Is this it?
- Uh-huh. That's the cave!

4
00:00:14.466 --> 00:00:17.099
- Na-na!
- That place?

5
00:00:17.166 --> 00:00:21.033
Is there something out of the ordinary inside?

6
00:00:21.099 --> 00:00:22.566
I'm not saying a thing.

7
00:00:22.633 --> 00:00:24.799
- You'll see for yourself!
- Okay!

8
00:00:24.866 --> 00:00:26.866
-Huh?

9
00:00:26.933 --> 00:00:30.033
-Aw!

10
00:00:31.866 --> 00:00:34.166
- What's all that?
- Isn't it cool?

11
00:00:34.233 --> 00:00:36.433
They call it Reflection Cave!

12
00:00:36.500 --> 00:00:37.966
Reflection Cave?

13
00:00:39.766 --> 00:00:42.933
Wow! These crystals are like big mirrors!

14
00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:48.066
Oh, incredible! These aren't normal, run-of-the-mill crystals.

15
00:00:48.133 --> 00:00:52.433
Their highly-reflective surfaces really do act just like a mirror does.

16
00:00:52.500 --> 00:00:54.966
Isn't it great? They're the perfect way

17
00:00:55.033 --> 00:00:59.033
to make certain you're looking your very best, like a full-length mirror!

18
00:00:59.099 --> 00:01:02.300
- Hm. How do I look?
- Huh? What do you mean?

19
00:01:02.366 --> 00:01:04.399
It keeps going on down there!

20
00:01:04.466 --> 00:01:07.066
- Ash?
- Where are you going?

21
00:01:07.133 --> 00:01:08.600
Don't leave us here!

22
00:01:08.666 --> 00:01:10.366
Hmm.

23
00:01:12.500 --> 00:01:14.600
Huh?

24
00:01:14.666 --> 00:01:19.000
No way! Hold on. I saw myself in the mirror but I...

25
00:01:19.066 --> 00:01:19.933
Pikachu!

26
00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:22.800
♪ I want to be the very best ♪

27
00:01:22.866 --> 00:01:26.366
♪ Like no one ever was ♪

28
00:01:26.433 --> 00:01:28.966
♪ To catch them is my real test ♪

29
00:01:29.033 --> 00:01:32.233
♪ To train them is my cause ♪

30
00:01:32.300 --> 00:01:35.300
♪ Pokémon! Got to catch them all It's you and me ♪

31
00:01:35.366 --> 00:01:38.366
♪ Pokémon! I know it's my destiny ♪

32
00:01:38.433 --> 00:01:41.933
♪ Pokémon! Yeah, you're my best friend ♪

33
00:01:42.000 --> 00:01:44.366
♪ In a world we must defend ♪

34
00:01:44.433 --> 00:01:46.866
♪ Pokémon! Got to catch them all ♪

35
00:01:46.933 --> 00:01:49.933
♪ Got to catch them all! Pokémon! ♪

36
00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:02.433
Ash, don't run! It's dangerous!

37
00:02:02.500 --> 00:02:07.000
I know, I know! Look at that. It's a dead end.

38
00:02:07.066 --> 00:02:10.766
Dead end? How many times have we gone around?

39
00:02:10.833 --> 00:02:12.500
It's like a maze in here.

40
00:02:12.566 --> 00:02:16.299
So I guess we should have made that turn back there after all.

41
00:02:16.366 --> 00:02:18.366
- Let's go back.
- Pika.

42
00:02:18.433 --> 00:02:22.433
- Ash, slow down!

43
00:02:22.500 --> 00:02:25.400
- I think it's this way!
- Not again.

44
00:02:25.466 --> 00:02:27.333
Let's go!

45
00:02:29.166 --> 00:02:30.833
What's that? Huh?

46
00:02:30.900 --> 00:02:33.666
- Hello? Hey, Ash?
- Over here!

47
00:02:33.733 --> 00:02:35.766
Here? Where?

48
00:02:35.833 --> 00:02:39.266
Another dead end. I guess we'd better go back.

49
00:02:39.333 --> 00:02:40.733
Pikachu!

50
00:02:42.700 --> 00:02:46.733
Huh? Hey! Serena! Clemont! Bonnie!

51
00:02:46.799 --> 00:02:50.799
- Ash!
- Don't move! Stay right there!

52
00:02:50.866 --> 00:02:52.266
Right, Clemont!

53
00:02:56.566 --> 00:02:59.366
-Pika!

54
00:03:02.900 --> 00:03:05.133
Pika!

55
00:03:05.200 --> 00:03:06.799
Get back here!

56
00:03:06.866 --> 00:03:08.700
- Huh?
- It's Ash!

57
00:03:08.766 --> 00:03:12.066
Give Pikachu back!

58
00:03:15.500 --> 00:03:18.100
- Huh? Oh, no!
- Impossible!

59
00:03:18.166 --> 00:03:21.366
- Ash disappeared into the mirror!
- Na-na?

60
00:03:21.433 --> 00:03:23.966
But how could that happen?

61
00:03:28.533 --> 00:03:32.633
Ah. Huh? Where am I?

62
00:03:34.333 --> 00:03:37.200
Pikachu!

63
00:03:37.266 --> 00:03:40.166
- Hey, Ash!
- Huh?

64
00:03:40.233 --> 00:03:42.833
- Well, well!
- Serena!

65
00:03:42.899 --> 00:03:45.666
- Where have you been?
- Huh?

66
00:03:45.733 --> 00:03:50.733
- Just 'cause I called you a crybaby!
- Who, me? Crybaby?

67
00:03:50.799 --> 00:03:54.133
- Why are you talking like that?
- Look, it's Ash!

68
00:03:54.200 --> 00:03:56.200
Brother dear, I've located him!

69
00:03:56.266 --> 00:03:57.533
Huh? Brother dear?

70
00:04:00.666 --> 00:04:03.799
I went too far!

71
00:04:03.866 --> 00:04:05.866
Ash, we've been searching all over for you!

72
00:04:05.933 --> 00:04:09.966
Huh? Awesome! I can't believe how fast you've gotten, Clemont!

73
00:04:10.033 --> 00:04:11.666
Now what do you mean?

74
00:04:11.733 --> 00:04:14.933
I've always been the fastest runner. I'm really good!

75
00:04:15.000 --> 00:04:17.200
- You're kidding me.
- Never mind that!

76
00:04:17.266 --> 00:04:20.666
- So where's that Pikachu of yours?
- Oh, yeah, now, get this.

77
00:04:20.733 --> 00:04:23.033
Another me popped out from inside the mirror,

78
00:04:23.099 --> 00:04:25.400
then grabbed Pikachu and ran off!

79
00:04:25.466 --> 00:04:29.000
- What are you talking about?
- Was it a dream, perchance?

80
00:04:29.066 --> 00:04:33.099
I was awake! So I jumped into the mirror and took off after the Ash

81
00:04:33.166 --> 00:04:36.266
who grabbed Pikachu and that's when I wound up here!

82
00:04:36.333 --> 00:04:37.800
Hm.

83
00:04:37.866 --> 00:04:42.400
Hm! You are different than the normal crybaby Ash I know.

84
00:04:42.466 --> 00:04:46.633
- Me? Crybaby?
- So maybe the culprit is...

85
00:04:46.700 --> 00:04:49.466
Our crybaby Ash!

86
00:04:49.533 --> 00:04:52.900
- Come to think of it, there is a legend.
- A legend?

87
00:04:52.966 --> 00:04:58.033
Correct! There's a famous legend about the cave that lies right up ahead!

88
00:04:59.099 --> 00:05:02.833
You see, the legend states for every crystal mirror in the cave,

89
00:05:02.900 --> 00:05:07.366
- there exists an alternate world.
- An alternate world for every mirror?

90
00:05:07.433 --> 00:05:11.833
Right and there's one more important point, but I can't remember it.

91
00:05:11.900 --> 00:05:13.866
Sounds stupid!

92
00:05:13.933 --> 00:05:18.933
Regardless, the Ash standing right here in front of us is not the Ash we know!

93
00:05:19.000 --> 00:05:22.133
Huh? You know, as weird as it's going to sound,

94
00:05:22.200 --> 00:05:24.233
I've got to admit that the three of you aren't

95
00:05:24.300 --> 00:05:26.966
the Serena, Clemont and Bonnie I know either.

96
00:05:27.033 --> 00:05:30.533
Hold on! I'm the only me and anyone who isn't me's not me!

97
00:05:30.599 --> 00:05:35.433
Now, what in the world did I just say? Whatever! Here's the deal!

98
00:05:35.500 --> 00:05:38.599
If you can beat me in a battle then I'll have to believe you!

99
00:05:38.666 --> 00:05:42.766
Uh, okay! You're on!

100
00:05:42.833 --> 00:05:45.966
Huh, I like the kind of Ash who would agree to accept

101
00:05:46.033 --> 00:05:48.033
- a challenge from Serena!
- Na-na!

102
00:05:51.833 --> 00:05:55.333
Prepare yourselves for a one-on-one Pokémon battle!

103
00:05:55.400 --> 00:05:57.266
And begin!

104
00:05:59.599 --> 00:06:05.166
- Fennekin, let's do this!
- Fenn!

105
00:06:05.233 --> 00:06:09.933
She's going with Fennekin. So in that case, I choose you!

106
00:06:11.466 --> 00:06:14.966
- Fro!
- Hm! Fennekin, use Flamethrower!

107
00:06:15.033 --> 00:06:18.000
- Fennekin!
- Froakie, Water Pulse!

108
00:06:18.066 --> 00:06:20.633
Froakie!

109
00:06:21.633 --> 00:06:23.833
Use Scratch!

110
00:06:23.900 --> 00:06:25.533
Now Double Team!

111
00:06:25.599 --> 00:06:27.000
Fro! Fro! fro!

112
00:06:27.066 --> 00:06:30.200
Oh, boy! I can't tell which one is real!

113
00:06:30.266 --> 00:06:33.099
- Fennekin!
- Bubble!

114
00:06:35.533 --> 00:06:37.366
Fenn!

115
00:06:37.433 --> 00:06:41.566
Fennekin is unable to battle, so the winner is Ash!

116
00:06:41.633 --> 00:06:44.400
- Thanks, Froakie. Return!
- Froakie!

117
00:06:45.733 --> 00:06:49.299
You battled well. Take a nice rest, okay?

118
00:06:51.066 --> 00:06:55.766
Serena, now will you believe what I told you?

119
00:06:55.833 --> 00:06:59.400
I would never lose to the Ash I know so I have to!

120
00:06:59.466 --> 00:07:01.833
I guess you're Ash from another world!

121
00:07:01.900 --> 00:07:06.299
Glad that's settled. o where's the crybaby Ash we're all familiar with?

122
00:07:06.366 --> 00:07:09.566
- Here I am.
- Huh?

123
00:07:11.233 --> 00:07:12.799
Pi! Pika! Pi!

124
00:07:12.866 --> 00:07:15.799
It appears there are two of them.

125
00:07:15.866 --> 00:07:19.966
- Pika! Pi!
- Pikachu! Buddy! I was so worried!

126
00:07:20.033 --> 00:07:22.966
Pika, pi. Pika!

127
00:07:23.033 --> 00:07:25.500
Hey Ash. Can you tell me what happened?

128
00:07:25.566 --> 00:07:28.966
Sure. It was after my battle with Serena.

129
00:07:30.133 --> 00:07:33.333
Froakie is unable to battle. So the winner is Serena!

130
00:07:33.400 --> 00:07:35.933
Told you! Now you see how strong I am?

131
00:07:38.666 --> 00:07:42.799
- You're not crying again, are you?
- No! I'm not crying!

132
00:07:42.866 --> 00:07:46.966
Oh, yes, you are! Check it out! Look at crybaby Ash!

133
00:07:47.033 --> 00:07:49.966
- You're mean. That's it!
- Pika?

134
00:07:50.033 --> 00:07:53.700
- From now on, I'm going to travel alone!
- Pika!

135
00:07:53.766 --> 00:07:56.299
Ash! I was just messing with you!

136
00:07:56.366 --> 00:08:02.400
I just ran off without thinking and then I saw a cave so I ran inside.

137
00:08:04.933 --> 00:08:11.299
But all of a sudden, I got lost and the next thing I knew, Pikachu was gone.

138
00:08:11.366 --> 00:08:14.566
Pikachu! Where are you?

139
00:08:15.633 --> 00:08:17.099
Pikachu!

140
00:08:21.733 --> 00:08:23.766
- Pikachu.
- Huh?

141
00:08:23.833 --> 00:08:26.233
Pikachu!

142
00:08:26.299 --> 00:08:28.333
Pika! Pika!

143
00:08:28.400 --> 00:08:30.066
Thank goodness!

144
00:08:30.133 --> 00:08:33.799
But after that, I realized it wasn't my Pikachu.

145
00:08:33.866 --> 00:08:35.866
I'm really, really sorry.

146
00:08:35.933 --> 00:08:40.100
No prob. I've got my Pikachu back and that's what counts.

147
00:08:40.166 --> 00:08:43.633
- Pika! Pikachu!
- Strange things happen, I suppose.

148
00:08:43.699 --> 00:08:46.166
Wow! That's kind of confusing.

149
00:08:46.233 --> 00:08:51.233
Hey, it'd be awesome if you'd tell me a little bit about your Pikachu.

150
00:08:51.300 --> 00:08:55.833
To tell the truth my Pikachu's tough, wild and aggressive!

151
00:08:55.900 --> 00:08:57.133
Chu!

152
00:08:59.699 --> 00:09:04.000
-Your volts will be no good in this globe!

153
00:09:04.066 --> 00:09:07.466
Pikachu! Pika!

154
00:09:07.533 --> 00:09:10.400
-Huh?

155
00:09:12.966 --> 00:09:18.366
- Why you! Gotcha!
- Pikachu.

156
00:09:18.433 --> 00:09:21.033
Is this the same Pikachu we know and love?

157
00:09:21.100 --> 00:09:24.900
We saw this rascal with the twerp and there can only be one of him!

158
00:09:24.966 --> 00:09:26.866
Wobbuffet!

159
00:09:26.933 --> 00:09:30.433
I can't just leave you hanging when you're in trouble!

160
00:09:30.500 --> 00:09:33.800
I'll tell you what. I'm going to help you find your Pikachu!

161
00:09:33.866 --> 00:09:36.566
Wow, Ash, thank you!

162
00:09:36.633 --> 00:09:39.766
All these Ashes are scrambling my brain.

163
00:09:39.833 --> 00:09:42.966
But how are we going to conduct this search for Pikachu?

164
00:09:43.033 --> 00:09:45.066
Uh-huh. Let me see.

165
00:09:48.533 --> 00:09:51.066
Uh-oh. Ash hasn't come back yet.

166
00:09:51.133 --> 00:09:54.266
And we haven't been able to go through the mirror after him.

167
00:09:54.333 --> 00:09:57.066
So how do we find out where he went?

168
00:09:57.133 --> 00:09:59.133
It looks like it's up to me.

169
00:09:59.199 --> 00:10:01.699
The future is now, thanks to science!

170
00:10:01.766 --> 00:10:03.000
Clemontic Gear on!

171
00:10:03.066 --> 00:10:07.833
You see I thought that we would encounter a situation precisely like this one!

172
00:10:07.900 --> 00:10:10.900
I call it the Other Dimension Converter!

173
00:10:10.966 --> 00:10:13.633
- Other Dimension Converter?
- I'm confused.

174
00:10:14.699 --> 00:10:18.199
This device makes high-voltage electromagnetic waves collide,

175
00:10:18.266 --> 00:10:23.000
which warps space and time, creating a portal to another dimension!

176
00:10:23.066 --> 00:10:24.333
Power on!

177
00:10:28.766 --> 00:10:33.766
I thought we would encounter a situation like this so I prepared this magic spell!

178
00:10:33.833 --> 00:10:37.033
I call it my Magical Direction Finder!

179
00:10:37.100 --> 00:10:39.733
Magical Direction Finder?

180
00:10:39.800 --> 00:10:42.733
By dropping the staff in the center of this circle,

181
00:10:42.800 --> 00:10:46.500
it will then allow us to determine which direction to search in!

182
00:10:46.566 --> 00:10:50.133
Now, here we go! Clemont Cadabra!

183
00:10:52.633 --> 00:10:55.466
Hm! Ash's Pikachu's over that way!

184
00:10:55.533 --> 00:10:58.000
Excellent, brother dear!

185
00:10:58.066 --> 00:11:00.866
- So let's check it out!
- All right, let's go!

186
00:11:00.933 --> 00:11:04.266
No! I can't believe you blew it again!

187
00:11:04.333 --> 00:11:06.100
I'm sorry.

188
00:11:08.566 --> 00:11:12.933
Now what do we do? Has Ash disappeared forever?

189
00:11:13.000 --> 00:11:15.500
Who's that Pokémon?

190
00:11:20.000 --> 00:11:22.733
It's Wobbuffet!

191
00:11:26.000 --> 00:11:27.500
Chu!

192
00:11:27.566 --> 00:11:30.100
This dope doesn't know when to quit!

193
00:11:30.166 --> 00:11:33.166
Yup. What a waste of watts.

194
00:11:33.233 --> 00:11:35.233
Hm? Company.

195
00:11:35.300 --> 00:11:37.966
We'd better make our bad selves scarce.

196
00:11:38.033 --> 00:11:39.233
Huh?

197
00:11:39.300 --> 00:11:41.833
Oh, it's a dead end!

198
00:11:41.900 --> 00:11:44.933
Now, where in the world is that Pikachu?

199
00:11:45.000 --> 00:11:48.433
- Wish I knew!
- Even brother dear makes mistakes!

200
00:11:50.466 --> 00:11:53.000
- Huh?
- Who knew the twerp had a twin?

201
00:11:53.066 --> 00:11:55.233
With another Pikachu in tow!

202
00:11:55.300 --> 00:11:58.033
This situation's starting to make my hair hurt.

203
00:11:58.100 --> 00:11:59.133
Your hair?

204
00:11:59.199 --> 00:12:03.133
Can the kvetching for later and let's grab that Pikachu for now!

205
00:12:03.199 --> 00:12:06.533
- You can't have too many, I always say.
- Wobbuffet!

206
00:12:06.600 --> 00:12:11.066
What do I do? I can't stand the thought of never seeing Pikachu again.

207
00:12:11.133 --> 00:12:14.833
I'll... I'll... I'll never be the same!

208
00:12:14.900 --> 00:12:18.566
- Just perfect. Here we go!
- Come on, Ash, don't cry!

209
00:12:18.633 --> 00:12:21.800
- Pikachu.
- You want to find Pikachu, don't you?

210
00:12:21.866 --> 00:12:23.300
Hm-hm.

211
00:12:23.366 --> 00:12:26.133
- Okay, don't give up!
- Pika! Pika!

212
00:12:29.699 --> 00:12:31.500
Pika!

213
00:12:32.500 --> 00:12:34.199
- Perfect aim!
- Hey, what!

214
00:12:34.266 --> 00:12:36.866
Prepare for trouble, hey what or not!

215
00:12:36.933 --> 00:12:39.199
And make it double, you can see what we've got.

216
00:12:39.266 --> 00:12:41.699
To protect the world from devastation!

217
00:12:41.766 --> 00:12:44.599
To unite all people within our nation!

218
00:12:44.666 --> 00:12:47.433
To denounce the evils of a twerpish twin!

219
00:12:47.500 --> 00:12:50.866
To extend our reach to the stars that spin!

220
00:12:50.933 --> 00:12:53.400
- Jessie!
- And James!

221
00:12:53.466 --> 00:12:56.166
Team Rocket blasts off at the speed of light!

222
00:12:56.233 --> 00:12:59.233
Surrender now or prepare yourselves for a fight!

223
00:12:59.300 --> 00:13:02.566
- Meowth, that's right!
- Wobbuffet!

224
00:13:04.599 --> 00:13:07.900
- Team Rocket! Not you again!
- Team Rocket?

225
00:13:07.966 --> 00:13:12.599
Uh-huh! They're a bunch of really bad guys who steal other people's Pokémon!

226
00:13:12.666 --> 00:13:16.366
Huh? Our Team Rocket folks call themselves the Heroes of Justice

227
00:13:16.433 --> 00:13:20.633
- They beat up bad guys!
- Huh? Heroes of Justice?

228
00:13:22.866 --> 00:13:25.566
- Hey Ash. That's my Pikachu!
- What?

229
00:13:25.633 --> 00:13:28.466
- So you're a bad Team Rocket, huh?
- Na-na-na!

230
00:13:28.533 --> 00:13:31.466
Now, look! Give us back our Pikachu!

231
00:13:31.533 --> 00:13:35.233
- Sure! Soon as you grow up!
- It's show time!

232
00:13:35.300 --> 00:13:36.800
- Pumpkaboo!
- Inkay!

233
00:13:36.866 --> 00:13:39.033
- Hey, Ash, let's go!
- Mm!

234
00:13:39.099 --> 00:13:41.099
I choose you!

235
00:13:41.166 --> 00:13:43.599
- LUCHA!
- Lucha.

236
00:13:43.666 --> 00:13:45.966
You chose Hawlucha, too?

237
00:13:46.033 --> 00:13:47.666
Use Karate Chop on Inkay!

238
00:13:47.733 --> 00:13:50.733
Hawlucha!

239
00:13:52.166 --> 00:13:57.099
Hawlucha.

240
00:13:57.166 --> 00:14:00.833
-Hawlucha, look out!

241
00:14:00.900 --> 00:14:02.933
Hawlucha!

242
00:14:03.000 --> 00:14:06.233
- Inkay, Psybeam!
- Inkay!

243
00:14:06.300 --> 00:14:07.800
Ha! Cha!

244
00:14:07.866 --> 00:14:11.266
- Hawlucha!
- Cha! Haw!

245
00:14:11.333 --> 00:14:14.566
Hawlucha's confused! All right, return!

246
00:14:15.566 --> 00:14:17.866
I'm sorry, Hawlucha.

247
00:14:17.933 --> 00:14:21.766
All right, Shadow Ball!

248
00:14:25.300 --> 00:14:29.400
- Are you okay, Ash?
- Yeah. No good.

249
00:14:29.466 --> 00:14:34.199
Looks like I'm finished.

250
00:14:34.266 --> 00:14:37.500
Come on! Your crying isn't going to do you any good!

251
00:14:38.800 --> 00:14:43.500
Yeah. We haven't lost anything yet! There's no reason to give up!

252
00:14:43.566 --> 00:14:45.233
Huh?

253
00:14:45.300 --> 00:14:47.133
Okay. I hear you.

254
00:14:48.866 --> 00:14:51.666
Pika! Pika! Pikachu!

255
00:14:51.733 --> 00:14:54.300
- Huh?
- Huh?

256
00:14:54.366 --> 00:14:57.066
Look, twerp, what are you doing?

257
00:14:57.133 --> 00:14:59.333
Oh, no, you don't!

258
00:14:59.400 --> 00:15:01.233
Wo! Wo! Wo! Wo! Wo! Wo!

259
00:15:01.300 --> 00:15:04.633
- Clemont?
- That's my big brother!

260
00:15:04.699 --> 00:15:10.000
- Here goes!
- Leave the rest to me!

261
00:15:10.066 --> 00:15:12.533
Fennekin! Your turn!

262
00:15:14.066 --> 00:15:16.366
Fenn!

263
00:15:16.433 --> 00:15:17.833
Pika!

264
00:15:17.900 --> 00:15:19.566
Pika!

265
00:15:19.633 --> 00:15:21.633
Let's wrap it up! Ready, Ash?

266
00:15:21.699 --> 00:15:23.699
7Okay, if you say so, Ash!

267
00:15:23.766 --> 00:15:27.266
Pikachu! Thunderbolt, let's go!

268
00:15:27.333 --> 00:15:30.766
-Pikachu!

269
00:15:30.833 --> 00:15:35.166
- We're blasting off again!
- Wobbuffet!

270
00:15:37.300 --> 00:15:41.033
- You were amazing, Ash!
- I was completely impressed!

271
00:15:41.099 --> 00:15:44.766
I hope you'll consider continuing our journey together, will you?

272
00:15:44.833 --> 00:15:47.866
- Mm-hm.
- Ash, that's awesome!

273
00:15:47.933 --> 00:15:50.099
Don't forget I owe it all to you.

274
00:15:53.466 --> 00:15:56.000
Let's head on over to the Pokémon Center.

275
00:15:56.066 --> 00:15:58.066
It's going to be dark soon.

276
00:15:59.066 --> 00:16:02.633
Dark soon. Huh! How could I forget?

277
00:16:02.699 --> 00:16:06.066
According to the legend, people who come from another world

278
00:16:06.133 --> 00:16:07.800
can't go back once the sun sets!

279
00:16:07.866 --> 00:16:09.599
-Pika!

280
00:16:10.633 --> 00:16:12.266
Here!

281
00:16:12.333 --> 00:16:15.099
Soon as this mirror started to waver,

282
00:16:15.166 --> 00:16:17.766
that's when I was able to go right into it!

283
00:16:17.833 --> 00:16:21.866
Let me see. I'd say the instability of the wavering mirror

284
00:16:21.933 --> 00:16:26.333
is functioning as something of a gate between this world and the other one.

285
00:16:26.400 --> 00:16:29.433
But how do we get this mirror to do it again?

286
00:16:29.500 --> 00:16:32.633
I'm not sure. Right before it started to waver...

287
00:16:33.733 --> 00:16:35.333
Pikachu.

288
00:16:37.199 --> 00:16:40.866
That's it! I really wanted to find Pikachu.

289
00:16:40.933 --> 00:16:44.933
When I started wishing really hard for that, then the mirror wavered.

290
00:16:45.000 --> 00:16:49.699
Wishing really hard, that just might have something to do with it!

291
00:16:49.766 --> 00:16:53.066
You really want to return to your own world, don't you?

292
00:16:53.133 --> 00:16:57.099
Yeah! Of course I want to continue on my journey with Clemont, Serena, and Bonnie!

293
00:16:57.166 --> 00:16:59.633
All right, focus on that thought!

294
00:16:59.699 --> 00:17:04.433
And if your thoughts are powerful enough, our two worlds might just reconnect!

295
00:17:04.500 --> 00:17:07.399
Okay! If that's what it takes, I can do it!

296
00:17:07.466 --> 00:17:11.800
Let's go back, so we can continue on our journey with our good friends!

297
00:17:11.866 --> 00:17:13.733
Pika! pika!

298
00:17:16.000 --> 00:17:18.166
Are we ever going to see Ash again?

299
00:17:18.233 --> 00:17:21.599
Of course we will, Bonnie. Don't even ask that!

300
00:17:21.666 --> 00:17:24.200
- Ash is coming back!
- That's right.

301
00:17:24.266 --> 00:17:27.399
And Pikachu, too. We've got to hold onto hope!

302
00:17:27.466 --> 00:17:29.899
- Mm.
- Na-na-na!

303
00:17:33.533 --> 00:17:36.133
Clemont, Bonnie, Serena!

304
00:17:37.133 --> 00:17:38.633
Pika?

305
00:17:38.700 --> 00:17:40.800
-Pika!

306
00:17:44.100 --> 00:17:45.966
- It's Ash!
- It worked!

307
00:17:46.033 --> 00:17:48.066
There are two Ashes?

308
00:17:48.133 --> 00:17:50.133
- Two of us, too!
- There's no time.

309
00:17:50.200 --> 00:17:53.866
We'll explain later! Our worlds are starting to move apart!

310
00:17:55.433 --> 00:17:57.200
The sun's starting to set!

311
00:17:57.266 --> 00:18:00.700
The two worlds are connected by our hopes and dreams!

312
00:18:00.766 --> 00:18:02.933
- Pika!
- Get with it, Serena!

313
00:18:03.000 --> 00:18:06.133
You need to concentrate on how much you want to journey with Ash!

314
00:18:06.200 --> 00:18:08.666
Huh? Hmm.

315
00:18:08.733 --> 00:18:11.833
- Clemont and Bonnie, too!
- Concentrate your thoughts!

316
00:18:11.899 --> 00:18:13.466
- We'll do it!
- Okay, we'll do it!

317
00:18:13.533 --> 00:18:16.000
Clemont! Bonnie! Serena!

318
00:18:16.066 --> 00:18:18.933
- Pika!
- Come back, Ash! Pikachu!

319
00:18:25.566 --> 00:18:27.566
-Pika!

320
00:18:30.100 --> 00:18:32.933
-Pikachu!

321
00:18:33.000 --> 00:18:36.033
- Argh!
- Hold on!

322
00:18:36.100 --> 00:18:37.800
- We've got you!
- Okay.

323
00:18:37.866 --> 00:18:40.266
Pika! Pika!

324
00:18:49.333 --> 00:18:53.200
- You're safe!
- Everybody, thank you!

325
00:18:53.266 --> 00:18:54.733
Pika! Pika.

326
00:18:57.800 --> 00:19:00.233
Hey, Ash! You take care!

327
00:19:00.300 --> 00:19:03.233
Serena, take care of your Ash, got it?

328
00:19:03.300 --> 00:19:05.899
- Bye, you guys!
- Everybody stay well!

329
00:19:05.966 --> 00:19:07.633
I do hope we'll meet again!

330
00:19:07.700 --> 00:19:09.966
Yeah! I'm looking forward to it!

331
00:19:10.033 --> 00:19:12.566
Goodbye, other Bonnie!

332
00:19:12.633 --> 00:19:14.833
Bye-bye!

333
00:19:19.933 --> 00:19:22.600
You know, I can still hardly believe it.

334
00:19:22.666 --> 00:19:26.366
Wow, the other Bonnie said "I do hope we'll meet again!"

335
00:19:26.433 --> 00:19:30.300
It is a possibility that the portal will open up again sometime.

336
00:19:30.366 --> 00:19:32.966
In order to prepare for that, I'll invent-

337
00:19:33.033 --> 00:19:36.700
They said they're all going to continue on their journey together as friends.

338
00:19:36.766 --> 00:19:39.899
So let's do that too! Off to the next Gym!

339
00:19:39.966 --> 00:19:41.633
Pikachu!

340
00:19:44.166 --> 00:19:46.466
Ah, what a pretty sunset!

341
00:19:46.533 --> 00:19:50.533
I think we should locate a Pokémon Center before it gets dark.

342
00:19:52.733 --> 00:19:54.233
- Hey, Ash?
- Huh?

343
00:19:54.300 --> 00:19:57.500
We're going to stay on our journey together too right?

344
00:19:57.566 --> 00:20:00.500
Of course we are! Wouldn't want it any other way.

345
00:20:00.566 --> 00:20:02.300
- Pika! Pika!
- We're a team!

346
00:20:02.366 --> 00:20:05.233
- And we're always going to be a team!
- Na-na-na!

347
00:20:08.300 --> 00:20:11.433
- Come on! Let's hurry, Serena!
- Right!

348
00:20:11.500 --> 00:20:14.866
Following their strange experience in Reflection Cave,

349
00:20:14.933 --> 00:20:19.333
it's off to the Pokémon Center, as our heroes' journey continues!

350
00:20:23.633 --> 00:20:27.466
That double Thunderbolt from those twin Pikachu really stung.

351
00:20:27.533 --> 00:20:29.866
-Two twerps are two too many.

352
00:20:29.933 --> 00:20:31.433
What's with this place?

353
00:20:31.500 --> 00:20:33.966
What's with this place is compassionate might!

354
00:20:34.033 --> 00:20:36.566
And goodness and caring, with mercy and light!

355
00:20:36.633 --> 00:20:39.000
Heroes of Justice, that's right!

356
00:20:39.066 --> 00:20:40.733
Wobbuffet!

357
00:20:40.800 --> 00:20:42.866
Oh, no!

358
00:20:42.933 --> 00:20:44.366
Wobbuffet!

359
00:20:44.433 --> 00:20:47.033
Team Rocket. Good night!
